  </a>
</i>
 , from
 <i class="Latn mention" lang="sla-pro">
<a href="/wiki/Reconstruction:Proto-Slavic/pasti" title="Reconstruction:Proto-Slavic/pasti">
   *pasti
  </a>
</i>
<span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">
  (
 </span>
<span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">
  “
 </span>
<span class="mention-gloss">
